---
<footer class="no-print" style="background-color: var(--color-canvas); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); padding: 3rem 0 2rem 0; color: var(--color-body); font-size: 0.875rem;">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 32px; padding-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);">
      
      <!-- Column 1: Brand Info -->
      <div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 1.1rem;">
          <div style="width: 24px; height: 24px; background: var(--color-ink); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 0.75rem;">
            R
          </div>
          Rafter Calculator
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px; color: var(--color-mute); line-height: 1.5; font-size: 0.8125rem;">
          Free online rafter & roof framing calculator. Calculate rafter length, total rise, plumb cuts, birdsmouth seat cuts, and lumber estimates directly in your browser.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Tools -->
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 10px;">Framing Tools</div>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li><a href="/#calculator" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">Rafter Length Calculator</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#visualizer" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">2D Vector Schematic Canvas</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#estimator" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">Material & Lumber Takeoff</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#guide" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">Pitch Conversion Chart</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#faq" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">Framing FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Legal & Support -->
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 10px;">Pages</div>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li><a href="/about" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">About Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">Contact Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms" style="color: var(--color-body); text-decoration: none;">Terms & Conditions</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 4: Measurement Support -->
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 10px;">Supported Units</div>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; color: var(--color-mute); font-size: 0.8125rem;">
          <li>• Inches (in) & Fractional 1/16"</li>
          <li>• Feet & Inches (ft - in)</li>
          <li>• Centimeters (cm)</li>
          <li>• Meters (m)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 5: Framing Compliance -->
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 10px;">Framing Reference</div>
        <p style="color: var(--color-mute); font-size: 0.8125rem; line-height: 1.5;">
          Calculations follow standard geometric hypotenuse rules and International Residential Code (IRC) birdsmouth notch safety limits.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Copyright -->
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-mute);">
      <div>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Raftercalculator.org. All rights reserved. Built for roofers, carpenters, and builders.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
